				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9675996 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9675996" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Since more than 80 varieties of gemstones are found within its borders, Idaho&rsquo;s nickname is the Gem State.</p>								</div>
