				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
															<img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="631" src="https://idaho.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sun-Valley-1024x631.jpeg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-3680" alt="View at Sun Valley Ski Resort over the town of Ketchum from a snowy mountain slope." srcset="https://idaho.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sun-Valley-1024x631.jpeg 1024w, https://idaho.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sun-Valley-300x185.jpeg 300w, https://idaho.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sun-Valley-768x473.jpeg 768w, https://idaho.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sun-Valley-1536x947.jpeg 1536w, https://idaho.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Sun-Valley-2048x1262.jpeg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px">															</div>
