				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2e7d405 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-absolute elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-image" data-id="2e7d405" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-settings='{"_position":"absolute"}' data-widget_type="image.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
																<a href="#elementor-action%3Aaction%3Dlightbox%26settings%3DeyJ1cmwiOiJodHRwczpcL1wvaWRhaG8uZ292XC93cC1jb250ZW50XC91cGxvYWRzXC8yMDI1XC8wOVwvQ3JhdGVycy1vZi10aGUtTW9vbi1zY2FsZWQuanBlZyIsInR5cGUiOiJpbWFnZSIsInRpdGxlIjoiTGF2YSBmaWVsZHMgYW5kIHZvbGNhbmljIHJvY2sgZm9ybWF0aW9ucyBhdCBDcmF0ZXJzIG9mIHRoZSBNb29uIE5hdGlvbmFsIE1vbnVtZW50LiJ9">
							<img decoding="async" width="1" height="1" src="https://idaho.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Image-Detail.svg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-351" alt="Open image preview and view image description">								</a>
															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-eaab277 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="eaab277" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="TextRun SCXW114466648 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114466648 BCX8">In 1969, NASA Apollo astronauts trained at Idaho&rsquo;s&nbsp;<a href="https://www.nps.gov/crmo/index.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Craters of the Moon National Monument</a>&nbsp;because of its rugged lava fields that closely resembled the terrain they would </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114466648 BCX8">encounter</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW114466648 BCX8"> on the Moon.</span></span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" data-slide="6" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="6 of 18">
							<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5fbeb73 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child" data-id="5fbeb73" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
