							<img decoding="async" width="1" height="1" src="https://idaho.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Image-Detail.svg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-351" alt="Open image preview and view image description">								</a>
															</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5fe2b38 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5fe2b38" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="TextRun SCXW120301126 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW120301126 BCX8">Idaho is a hotspot for bird species. The&nbsp;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW120301126 BCX8"><a href="https://www.blm.gov/programs/national-conservation-lands/idaho/morley-nelson-snake-river-birds-of-prey" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Snake River Birds of Prey National Conservation Area</a>&nbsp;is home to the </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW120301126 BCX8">highest concentration of nesting birds of prey in North America.</span></span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
								</div>
											<div class="swiper-slide" data-slide="7" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="7 of 18">
