				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-f96f986 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="f96f986" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="TextRun SCXW49514524 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49514524 BCX8">Called the &ldquo;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW49514524 BCX8">Niagara</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49514524 BCX8"> of the West</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49514524 BCX8">&rdquo;,</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49514524 BCX8">&nbsp;<a href="https://visitidaho.org/things-to-do/natural-attractions/shoshone-falls/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shoshone Falls</a>&nbsp;is</span> <span class="NormalTextRun AdvancedProofingIssueV2Themed SCXW49514524 BCX8">actually higher</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49514524 BCX8"> than </span><span class="NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW49514524 BCX8">Niagara</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49514524 BCX8"> Falls and </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW49514524 BCX8">one of the largest natural waterfalls in the </span><span class="NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW49514524 BCX8">U.S.</span></span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
								</div>
