				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b4bb6cf elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="b4bb6cf" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="TextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8">Boise, t</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8">he capit</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8">a</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8">l of Idaho</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8">, is known as &ldquo;The City of Trees</span></span><span class="TextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8">&rdquo;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8"> closely tied to the origin of its name.</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8"> When </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8">F</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8">rench fur trappers first laid eyes on Boise, they shouted &ldquo;Les Bois!&rdquo; meaning &ldquo;the woods&rdquo;</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW14216059 BCX8"> in reference to the abundant trees in the area.</span></span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
								</div>
