				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7654f6f elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7654f6f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span data-contrast="none">Idaho is more than just potatoes, leading the nation in production of barley, organic alfalfa hay, peppermint oil, and food trout.</span></p>								</div>
				</div>
				</div>
