				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19256272 BCX8">Idaho is the leading </span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19256272 BCX8">producer</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19256272 BCX8"> of commercial trout</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19256272 BCX8"> nationwide</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW19256272 BCX8">, accounting for about 70% of total production.</span></p>								</div>
