				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="TextRun SCXW266987327 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266987327 BCX8">Idaho played a key role in the early development of nuclear energy</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW266987327 BCX8">, with small town Arco becoming the first city in the world powered by atomic energy.</span></span></p>								</div>
