				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="TextRun SCXW7216608 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="none"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7216608 BCX8">The&nbsp;<a href="https://idahodarksky.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Central Idaho Dark Sky Reserve</a>&nbsp;is recognized as th</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7216608 BCX8">e</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7216608 BCX8"> first gold-tier dark sky reserve in the U.S.</span><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7216608 BCX8">, </span></span><span class="TextRun SCXW7216608 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW7216608 BCX8">offering breathtaking views of the Milky Way and some of the clearest night skies in the country.</span></span></p>								</div>
