				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><span class="TextRun SCXW22256136 BCX8" lang="EN-US" xml:lang="EN-US" data-contrast="auto"><span class="NormalTextRun SCXW22256136 BCX8">Idaho has a rich tradition of folk music, with songs and stories passed down through generations reflecting its pioneer, cowboy, and Basque heritage.</span></span><span class="EOP SCXW22256136 BCX8" data-ccp-props='{"134233117":false,"134233118":false,"201341983":0,"335551550":1,"335551620":1,"335559685":720,"335559731":2160,"335559737":0,"335559738":0,"335559739":160,"335559740":279}'>&nbsp;</span></p>								</div>
